    <item>
      <title>AI圈“宫斗剧”上演：GPT-4o黯然退场，GPT-5光速上位！企业API独得恩宠？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aigpt-4ogpt-5api-20250808091005400-4/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 08 Aug 2025 09:10:05 +0800</pubDate>
